{"about_the_game":"Primordials: Battle of Gods is a pure 1vs1 strategy game where players rule kingdoms and build armies to war for ever greater power. Compete in 1v1 duels against other Primordials and their armies, simultaneously balancing resource management while choosing upgrade paths for buildings, champions and minions to gain key advantages on the battlefield. While even the greatest Primordial may not control every unit on the battlefield, some have abilities and ultimates that can turn the tide of war.<br><br>One Will Rise, Many Will Fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/604a8ea095a09890e32b8508fb446979.poster.avif?t=1615322424\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/604a8ea095a09890e32b8508fb446979.webm?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/604a8ea095a09890e32b8508fb446979.mp4?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><strong>Lord Over Land </strong>- Battle for control of the realm without the tedium of dictation. It's macro over micro.<br><br><strong>Choose Your Path</strong> - Upgrade Primordials, champions, minions and towers to directly counter an opponent's army.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/ae52357a95b13da209472b139474531e.poster.avif?t=1615322424\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/ae52357a95b13da209472b139474531e.webm?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/ae52357a95b13da209472b139474531e.mp4?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Battle of Wit and Will</strong> - Test your mettle in 1v1 duels. No teammates can steal glory or bring your great name to shame.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/8ccd6b78fde7351d1a0842350d263936.poster.avif?t=1615322424\" width=624 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/8ccd6b78fde7351d1a0842350d263936.webm?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/extras/8ccd6b78fde7351d1a0842350d263936.mp4?t=1615322424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Bolster Forces </strong>- Unleash devastating activatable abilities in support of valiant minions marching into a brutal war of attrition.<br><br><strong>Manage Resources </strong>- Spend resources early and go for the killing blow, or build up an economy in an effort to overwhelm the long-game.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1316870?t=1615322424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1615322424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1615322424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1615322424","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Primordials: Battle of Gods is a pure 1vs1 strategy game where players ru